WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:02.719
Hi, I'm Emil from Pongfinity

00:00:02.719 --> 00:00:05.270
And we are here at the TATA headquarters in
Beijing

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:07.880
to find who can do the best trick shots.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.940
And we have some special guests with us.

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:25.280
Open the door,

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:26.839
Hit the ball

00:00:26.839 --> 00:00:27.960
And close the door.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.080
Liu Guoliang, can you do this?

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:44.680
How about hitting two balls - consecutively?

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.680
Feng Tianwei, can you knock down the cups?

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:07.960
Easy!

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:26.120
For this next trick shots, I will be standing
up there,

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:28.270
7 meters high up

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:29.590
And I have to hit the ball

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:30.820
into the cup.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:50.280
Next it's ball floating time.

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:57.140
Bye bye!

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:00.460
Big thanks to TATA for having us here!

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:02.780
If you think you can do a better trick shot

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.130
record it and send it in.

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:06.350
Xie xie TATA, see you next year!

